    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9375,
      "back_translation": "有些国家禁止超市免费提供塑料袋，人们需要花钱购买，这样可以减少使用量。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.898,
      "back_translation": "还有一些国家完全禁止某些塑料制品，比如塑料吸管和餐具。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9167,
      "back_translation": "政府还会对生产塑料的企业征税，鼓励它们改用环保材料。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9091,
      "back_translation": "在欧洲，一些国家推出了“塑料瓶押金制度”。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9778,
      "back_translation": "顾客买饮料时多付一点钱，归还空瓶后就可以拿回押金。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.625,
      "back_translation": "这种方法大大提高了塑料瓶的回收率。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9067,
      "back_translation": "而亚洲的一些城市则加强了垃圾分类管理，规定居民必须把塑料垃圾单独投放，否则会被罚款。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7636,
      "back_translation": "虽然这些措施有时会给生活带来不便，但从长远来看对环境是有好处的。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9744,
      "back_translation": "虽然各国的政策不同，但目的都是减少塑料垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "科学家指出，塑料在自然环境中很难分解，会对海洋生物造成伤害。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
